# Wave W17-Q (Route 121): warden sand — cove-road sand: a warm pale sand running from the long rain down to Lotus Cove, drying as it goes (design-authorised: a clear connected path of pale sand running end to end, Route 120 to Lotus Cove). Split from Route 120’s grey wet ledger sand by warmth and value: this is the road out of the rain, and it shows.
